 *     {{ crud.boot(config) }}
 *
 * Scripts (Sortable.min.js → fs-dialogs.js → htmx-crud.js) load ONLY
 * through boot(); header/footer remain untouched (HCS-09).
 *
 * NOTE: boot() does NOT load htmx core — the consuming view MUST also
 * import Macro/Htmx.html.twig and call htmx.boot() (Twig macros cannot
 * call sibling macros).
 *
 * Macros: boot, table, toolbar, flashContainer, saveBar.
 */
